<title>UK: Stadshypotek sets $100 mln March 2001 FRN.</title>
<headline>Stadshypotek sets $100 mln March 2001 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STADSHYPOTEK AB</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	SPREAD     5 BP	MATURITY    26.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  99.95     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/SE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SWEDEN    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  7.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
